升高 "},{"type":"math","value":"1^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，水柱移动的距离相比竖直放置时 （填空）（选填“偏大”、“偏小”或“不变”），并说明理由。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/86463f876ee9fb1b745871471cdfedc610859e71201725af7c763fdd444a4e3d.png","width":133,"height":361,"width_mm":15.565,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 15 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）\n（1）减小，小于\n(2 分，每空各 1 分)\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{1} = (148 + 0.2 \\times 10)\\mathrm{cm}^{3} = 150\\mathrm{cm}^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1} = (273 + 27)\\mathrm{K} = 300\\mathrm{K}"},{"type":"text","value":"任意态"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{2}=(148+0.2\\times h)\\mathrm{cm}^{3}"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2} = (273 + t)\\mathrm{K}"},{"type":"text","value":"由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_1}{T_1} = \\frac{V_2}{T_2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"t=(23+0.4h)"},{"type":"text","value":"℃\n(1 分)\n因为"},{"type":"math","value":"0 \\leq h \\leq 15 \\, cm"},{"type":"text","value":"，代入以上结果可得"},{"type":"math","value":"23^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C} \\leq t \\leq 29^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n(3) 偏大\n(1 分，判断正确就可得分)\n水平放置，由于水柱重力产生的压强消失，相同温度变化量"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta T"},{"type":"text","value":"，体积变化量"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta V"},{"type":"text","value":"变大，水柱移动距离大。\n(1 分, 其它解答如有道理均可得分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509","source_question_id":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"932412758af0fa8aacee729837bff86d3b747c4410a7078fdbae4dac426ddf62","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）一游戏装置竖直截面如图所示，倾斜直轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 、螺旋轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"CDC^{'}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"C'E"},{"type":"text","value":" 平滑连接。 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 点紧挨着质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的小车，小车 "},{"type":"math","value":"E'F"},{"type":"text","value":" 段水平且与左侧平面等高，小车圆弧段 "},{"type":"math","value":"FG"},{"type":"text","value":" 与水平段 "},{"type":"math","value":"E'F"},{"type":"text","value":" 在 "},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":" 点相切。整个装置除 "},{"type":"math","value":"E'F"},{"type":"text","value":" 段粗糙外，其余各段均光滑。质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑块1从倾斜直轨道上高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"H"},{"type":"text","value":" 处静止释放，与静止在 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的质量也为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑块2发生碰撞并粘在一起，组合成滑块3冲上小车继续运动。已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.1\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，螺旋轨道半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 0.2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"E'F"},{"type":"text","value":" 段长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{E'F} = 1\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"E'F"},{"type":"text","value":" 段的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = 0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"G"},{"type":"text","value":" 到小车水平段的高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"h = 1\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，滑块1、2、3均可视为质点。\n（1）若 H=3R，求滑块 1 通过圆心等高的 D 点时受到合力的大小；\n（2）若 H=3R，固定小车，求滑块 3 在小车上滑行的距离 s；\n（3）若小车不固定，滑块 3 始终未离开小车，求 H 的范围。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/112bd97016f0095798c023b09c28dcf236efe4bd8d1dfa7ff73e863c20e1bdf5.png","width":882,"height":282,"width_mm":103.717,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：本卷中无特殊说明，重力加速度 g 均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"mg(H - R) = \\frac{1}{2} mv_D^2"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"F _ {D} = m \\frac {v _ {D} ^ {2}}{R}"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{合}}=\\sqrt{(mg)^2+F_D^2}=\\sqrt{17}\\,\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"mgH=\\frac{1}{2}mv_1^2"},{"type":"math","value":"m v _ {1} = 2 m v _ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {1}{2} \\times 2 m v _ {2} ^ {2} = \\mu \\times 2 m g s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {1} = \\sqrt {2 g H}"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {2} = \\frac {\\sqrt {2 g H}}{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"s=\\frac{H}{4\\mu}=0.3\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（3）①H 的最小值为恰好通过圆弧最高点。"},{"type":"math","value":"m g (H _ {1} - 2 R) = \\frac {1}{2} m v ^ {2}"},{"type":"math","value":"m g = m \\frac {v ^ {2}}{R}"},{"type":"math","value":"H_1=2.5R=0.5\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n②H 的最大值为滑块 3 恰好到 G 点或者恰好返回到达"},{"type":"math","value":"E'"},{"type":"math","value":"2 m v _ {2} = 4 m v _ {3}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {3} = \\frac {\\sqrt {2 g H}}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"设恰好到 G 点的高度为"},{"type":"math","value":"H_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":","},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {1}{2} \\times 2 m v _ {2} ^ {2} = \\mu \\times 2 m g L + 2 m g h + \\frac {1}{2} \\times 4 m v _ {3} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"H_2=8\\mu L+8h=12\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n设恰好返回到点"},{"type":"math","value":"E'"},{"type":"text","value":"的高度为"},{"type":"math","value":"H_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":","},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {1}{2} \\times 2 m v _ {2} ^ {2} = \\mu \\times 2 m g \\times 2 L + \\frac {1}{2} \\times 4 m v _ {3} ^ {2}"},{"type":"math","value":"H_3=16\\mu L=8\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"H_{3}<H_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":",所以H的最大值为"},{"type":"math","value":"H_{3}=8m"},{"type":"text","value":"所以"},{"type":"math","value":"0.5\\,\\mathrm{m}\\leq H\\leq 8\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509","source_question_id":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e34071e7e40459efc152446d142b78ce53440c608f749be6572530fd4bae6a9f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12 分）如图所示，质量为 m、边长为 l 的正方形线框 A，平放在光滑的水平面上，总电阻为 R，且均匀分布。A 的右侧有宽度为 3l 的匀强磁场，其左边界与线框 MN 边相距为 l。某时刻开始线框受到力 F 作用，静止开始沿 x 正方向做匀加速直线运动，恰好匀速进入磁场。当线框完全进入磁场时，撤去外力 F，已知 m=1kg，l=1m， "},{"type":"math","value":"R=2\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ，F=2N，求：\n（1）磁感应强度 B 的大小；\n（2）以磁场左边界为坐标原点，写出线框 A 从进入到离开磁场的过程中 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{MN}"},{"type":"text","value":" 与坐标 x 的关系式；\n（3）若线框出磁场的过程中，同时受到 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{f}} = kv"},{"type":"text","value":" （ "},{"type":"math","value":"k = 3\\mathrm{kg / s}"},{"type":"text","value":" ）的阻力，求整个过程线圈产生的焦耳热。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bbb692893bcd483d229bacb29a3529b76481c8dc29c53eecb32f85487dbd4563.png","width":660,"height":342,"width_mm":77.611,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 17 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）\n(1)设线圈达到磁场左边界的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"math","value":"v_0=\\sqrt{2\\frac{F}{m}l}=2\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n匀速穿过，"},{"type":"math","value":"F - \\frac{B^2l^2v_0}{R} = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\mathrm{T}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n（2）线圈匀速通过磁场左边界过程中，"},{"type":"math","value":"E = B l v _ {0} = 2 \\sqrt {2} \\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":"①"},{"type":"math","value":"0 \\leq x \\leq l"},{"type":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{MN} = -\\frac{3}{4} E = -\\frac{3}{2}\\sqrt{2} V"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n②"},{"type":"math","value":"l \\leq x \\leq 3l"},{"type":"text","value":"时,"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{MN} = -E = -2\\sqrt{2}V"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n③ 当"},{"type":"math","value":"3l \\leq x \\leq 4l"},{"type":"text","value":"时，假设线圈始终受安培力，减速到 0 的位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x"},{"type":"math","value":"- \\frac {B ^ {2} l ^ {2} \\Delta x}{R} = 0 - m v _ {0}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x=2\\,\\mathrm{m}>l=1\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"，线圈可以穿出磁场\n(1 分)\n在线圈出磁场过程中："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac{B^2l^2(x - 3l)}{R} = mv - mv_0"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"v = 5 - x"},{"type":"math","value":"3l\\leq x\\leq 4l"},{"type":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{MN}=-\\frac{Bl(5-x)}{4}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}(x-5)\\,\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（3）判断线圈是否会离开磁场："},{"type":"math","value":"- \\frac {B ^ {2} l ^ {2} \\Delta x ^ {'}}{R} - k \\Delta x ^ {'} = 0 - m v _ {0}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x'=0.5\\,\\mathrm{m}<1\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"，线圈未出磁场就停下来了\n(1 分)\n线圈进入磁场过程中:"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1}=F\\times l"},{"type":"math","value":"Q _ {1} = 2 \\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n线圈离开过程中："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Q_{Ff}}{Q_2} = \\frac{F_f}{F_A} = \\frac{kv}{\\frac{B^2l^2v}{R}} = 3"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_2=\\frac{1}{4}\\times \\frac{1}{2}mv_0^2=0.5\\,\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=Q_1+Q_2=2.5\\,\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509","source_question_id":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2509-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"46caf4289d331323edcd4175743e9a2235e7563ab627748b19f4b225fd90bfeb","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）托卡马克是受控核聚变中的常见的一种装